{
  "bodyHash": "e65540644cc453f4",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 作品。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">營火重生與微調（Campfire Spawn and Tweaks）新增了將重生點設定在營火上方的功能，並對該方塊的相關機制進行了一些調整。預設情況下，重生時您會獲得 10 秒的火焰抗性，並出現在營火正上方。此功能適用於主世界、下界與終界，也支援模組新增的維度。<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設設定下的功能特色：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">營火預設為未點燃狀態。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">點燃營火會在其正上方建立重生點。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">對著營火右鍵點擊沙子、泥土或靈魂沙可將其熄滅。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">對著被水淹沒的營火右鍵點擊打火石可移除水分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">點擊營火側面時，不會在相鄰方塊上放置火焰。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">若玩家重生於營火內，將獲得 10 秒的防火保護。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">若重生時營火上方有方塊，將自動創造一個兩格高的空氣空間。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">蹲下並右鍵點擊床可覆蓋營火重生點位置。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">蹲下並右鍵點擊營火可移除重生點。或在點燃時執行相同操作，以避免設定重生點。</span></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s RPG 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfiresStartUnlit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，新放置的營火將處於未點燃狀態。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sneakRightClickCampfireToUnset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">蹲下並右鍵點擊營火將取消營火重生點。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>bedsOverrideCampfireSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，在床中睡覺將覆蓋營火重生點。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createAirPocketIfBlocksAboveCampfire</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，重生時若營火上方有方塊阻擋，模組將破壞這些方塊。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnNewCampfireSpawnSet</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，每次設定新的營火重生點時都會向玩家發送訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnUnset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，每次取消營火重生點時都會向玩家發送訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnMissing</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，若重生時遺失營火重生點，會向玩家發送訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnOverride</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用時，若營火重生點被 PlayerSetSpawnEvent 事件覆蓋，會向玩家發送訊息。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>fireResitanceDurationOnRespawnInMs</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10000，最小 0，最大 3600000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家於營火重生時的火焰抗性持續時間（毫秒）。數值為 0 將停用此功能，改為將玩家放置在營火旁。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">放置並破壞營火，以設定和取消重生點：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在營火上方放置泥土以將其熄滅：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"552\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">於營火處重生：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">於下界中死亡並於下界重生：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">於主世界中死亡並於下界重生：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用打火石點燃營火以移除其水分：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在多個獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
